                                "sense_id": "25f7ed5f-4b4a-3912-b3ac-911c5afdf680",
                                "text": "Most of the gluten proteins, the gliadins and the glutenins, are around a thousand amino acids long. The gliadin chains fold onto themselves in a compact mass, and bond weakly with each other and with the glutenin proteins."
